{"id":"n55854-1-7","stage":1,"title":"목도리 · 围巾","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55854-1-7-1","ko":"목도리를 어떻게 매야 할지 모르겠어.","zh":"我不知道该怎么系围巾啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"목도리를","meaning":"围巾","explanation":"목도리：围巾；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"목도리","audio":"/audio/634f23a72357e4022c83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55854","senseId":"1","lemma":"목도리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목도리를","audio":"/audio/faff7819c9c7f38a4f75.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"매야","meaning":"打，系","explanation":"매다：打，系；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"매다","audio":"/audio/0341d7416782d5c7f5f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26487","senseId":"2","lemma":"매다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매야","audio":"/audio/a52b1233a9572d90e537.mp3"}},{"text":"할지","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；ㄹ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할지","audio":"/audio/156fd116c75acec033e4.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어","audio":"/audio/b0a5887fc79197b11412.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"634f23a72357e402","term":"목도리","zh":"围巾","audio":"/audio/634f23a72357e4022c83.mp3","entryId":"55854","definition":"为了抵御寒冷而围在脖子上的用品。","pronunciation":["목또리"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"0341d7416782d5c7","term":"매다","zh":"打，系","audio":"/audio/0341d7416782d5c7f5f9.mp3","entryId":"26487","definition":"将长的带子等围在或绑在身上。","pronunciation":["매ː다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9acc22e47dfdc04aac19.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55854-1-7-2","ko":"이리 와 봐. 내가 예쁘게 매 줄게.","zh":"过这儿来，我帮你系得漂漂亮亮的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이리","meaning":"往这边，朝这里","explanation":"이리：往这边，朝这里","readings":[{"term":"이리","audio":"/audio/062801c7a30dc6cea780.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91328","senseId":"1","lemma":"이리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이리","audio":"/audio/062801c7a30dc6cea780.mp3"}},{"text":"와","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"예쁘게","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예쁘게","audio":"/audio/34e05a9677358184f75a.mp3"}},{"text":"매","meaning":"打，系","explanation":"매다：打，系；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"매다","audio":"/audio/0341d7416782d5c7f5f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26487","senseId":"2","lemma":"매다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매","audio":"/audio/c4862fc6e236ff2ca383.mp3"}},{"text":"줄게.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄게","audio":"/audio/f81c77e211e7de437a74.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"062801c7a30dc6ce","term":"이리","zh":"往这边，朝这里","audio":"/audio/062801c7a30dc6cea780.mp3","entryId":"91328","definition":"向着这个地方；或向着这个方向。","pronunciation":["이리"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff